# Notes, sorted.
note sdkconfig: uses the legacy mbedTLS crypto API (CONFIG_MBEDTLS_AES_C)
note sdkconfig:1541: CONFIG_MBEDTLS_CMAC_C enables CMAC, which the algorithm catalogue does not list yet; not reported
note sdkconfig:1544: mbedTLS uses the MPI accelerator for big-number arithmetic (CONFIG_MBEDTLS_HARDWARE_MPI); RSA, DH and ECC still run in software around it, so none is marked as hardware
note sdkconfig:1547: CONFIG_MBEDTLS_ROM_MD5 enables MD5, which the algorithm catalogue does not list yet; not reported
note sdkconfig:1554: CONFIG_MBEDTLS_SHA1_C enables SHA-1, which the algorithm catalogue does not list yet; not reported
